# Versioned in srm/: the interleaved sample questions (srm.tex, srm_01–03.tex,
# srm_body.tex), the assets they \input, the official input in src/, the built
# srm.pdf and the README. The texify pipeline that produced the .tex files, its work
# directory, caches and the agent skill files stay local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!srm.tex
!srm_*.tex
!*.pdf
!assets/
!assets/**
!src/
!src/**
